---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="SmartUtilBox | fire">
    <div class="px-4 py-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-8">
         <section class="py-12 lg:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"> <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"> <div class="mb-8 text-center"> <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4" data-i18n="fire-h1">資產配置優化：提早退休時間分析</h2> <p class="text-slate-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto" data-i18n="fire-desc">根據「4% 法則」計算您的財務自由目標，並比較不同投資報酬率下，您能提早多少年重獲自由。</p> </div> <!-- Calculator Grid --> <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8"> <!-- Inputs Column --> <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6"> <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl  border-none p-6"> <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 text-slate-800 mb-6 border-b pb-2" data-i18n="fire-input-title">基本資料與現況</h3> <div class="space-y-4"> <div> <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1" data-i18n="fire-age">目前年齡</label> <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" id="currentAge" value="35" class="w-full px-4 py-2 bg-slate-50 border-none rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 focus:bg-white outline-none"> </div> <div> <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1" data-i18n="fire-target-age">預計退休年齡</label> <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" id="targetAge" value="65" class="w-full px-4 py-2 bg-slate-50 border-none rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 focus:bg-white outline-none"> </div> <div> <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1" data-i18n="fire-income">每月平均收入 (NT$)</label> <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" id="monthlyIncome" value="150,000" class="w-full px-4 py-2 bg-slate-50 border-none rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 focus:bg-white outline-none text-right font-semibold text-slate-800"> </div> <div> <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1" data-i18n="fire-expense">每月平均支出 (NT$)</label> <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" id="monthlyExpense" value="80,000" class="w-full px-4 py-2 bg-slate-50 border-none rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 focus:bg-white outline-none text-right font-semibold text-slate-800"> </div> <div> <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1" data-i18n="fire-capital">目前已累積投資本金 (NT$)</label> <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" id="currentCapital" value="2,000,000" class="w-full px-4 py-2 bg-slate-50 border-none rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 focus:bg-white outline-none text-right font-semibold text-slate-800"> </div> </div> </div> <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl  border-none p-6"> <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 text-slate-800 mb-6 border-b pb-2" data-i18n="fire-roi-title">預期年化報酬率設定</h3> <div class="space-y-4"> <div> <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1" data-i18n="fire-roi-current">方案 A：目前配置 (%)</label> <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" id="roiCurrent" value="2.0" class="w-full px-4 py-2 bg-slate-50 border-none rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 focus:bg-white outline-none text-right font-semibold text-slate-800"> </div> <div> <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1" data-i18n="fire-roi-optimal">方案 B：優化後配置 (%)</label> <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" id="roiOptimal" value="6.0" class="w-full px-4 py-2 bg-slate-50 border-none rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 focus:bg-white outline-none text-right font-semibold text-slate-800"> </div> </div> <div class="mt-6"> <button id="calculateBtn" class="w-full bg-slate-800 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-lg transition-colors shadow-md" data-i18n="fire-calc-btn"> 開始分析退休路徑 </button> </div> </div> </div> <!-- Results Column --> <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6"> <!-- Target Goal Card --> <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl  border border-emerald-600 border-t-4 p-8 text-center"> <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide text-sm" data-i18n="fire-target-label">您的財務自由目標金額 (4% 法則)</p> <h3 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-800 tracking-tight" id="fireTargetAmount">NT$ 24,000,000</h3> <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-4" data-i18n="fire-target-note">*依據您的年支出 × 25 倍計算</p> </div> <!-- Comparison Card --> <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl  border-none p-6 sm:p-8"> <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 text-slate-800 mb-6 text-center" data-i18n="fire-compare-title">達成目標所需時間對比</h3> <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 mb-8"> <!-- Plan A --> <div class="flex-1 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 border-none text-center relative"> <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-gray-200 text-slate-500 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold" data-i18n="fire-plan-a">方案 A (目前)</div> <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-1 mt-2" data-i18n="fire-years-needed">還需</p> <p class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900"><span id="yearsCurrent">--</span> <span class="text-lg font-normal" data-i18n="fire-year-unit">年</span></p> <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2" id="ageCurrentDesc">預計退休年齡: -- 歲</p> </div> <!-- Plan B --> <div class="flex-1 bg-green-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-emerald-600 text-center relative "> <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-emerald-600 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold" data-i18n="fire-plan-b">方案 B (優化)</div> <p class="text-green-700 text-sm mb-1 mt-2" data-i18n="fire-years-needed">只需</p> <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-emerald-700"><span id="yearsOptimal">--</span> <span class="text-xl font-normal" data-i18n="fire-year-unit">年</span></p> <p class="text-xs text-green-600 mt-2" id="ageOptimalDesc">預計退休年齡: -- 歲</p> </div> </div> <!-- Highlight Alert --> <div id="highlightBox" class="bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-accent p-5 rounded-r-lg hidden"> <div class="flex items-center"> <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg> <p class="text-amber-900 font-medium text-lg"> <span data-i18n="fire-highlight-pre">透過優化配置，您可以提早 </span> <span class="font-bold text-2xl text-accent mx-1" id="yearsSaved">--</span> <span data-i18n="fire-highlight-post"> 年重獲自由！</span> </p> </div> </div> <div id="errorBox" class="text-red-500 text-center text-sm hidden" data-i18n="fire-error-msg"> 計算無法收斂，請檢查輸入數值（例如收入需大於支出）。 </div> </div> </div> </div> <!-- Business Logic Banner (Lead Generation) --> <div class="mt-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900 to-primary rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-xl text-center text-white relative overflow-hidden"> <!-- Decorative bg --> <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-20 -mt-20 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-white opacity-5 blur-3xl"></div> <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 relative z-10" data-i18n="fire-cta-title">準備好啟動您的加速器了嗎？</h3> <p class="text-gray-300 mb-8 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto relative z-10" data-i18n="fire-cta-desc">想知道如何從 2% 提升到 6% 的穩健配置，甚至引入實體另類資產（如威士忌）來對沖風險嗎？讓專業顧問協助您打造專屬的提早退休藍圖。</p> <a href="/coaching" class="relative z-10 inline-block bg-accent hover:bg-yellow-500 text-gray-900 font-bold py-4 px-10 rounded-full transition-transform transform hover:scale-105 shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 border border-slate-100 text-lg"> <span data-i18n="fire-cta-btn">預約免費 15 分鐘財務破口分析</span> </a> </div> </div> </section> <!-- Quick Needs Submission Block --> <section class="bg-white py-10 border-t border-b border-slate-200 flex-shrink-0 mt-8"> <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center"> <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900" data-i18n="footer-cta-title">對理財有疑問？留下一句話，讓我們開始對話。</h2> <form action="/contact" method="GET" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 max-w-xl mx-auto"> <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="您的 Email" class="px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-900 placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-slate-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 w-full sm:w-auto flex-1 shadow-sm" required> <button type="submit" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white shadow-md font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-md transition duration-300 w-full sm:w-auto shadow-md" data-i18n="footer-cta-btn"> 開始諮詢 </button> </form> </div> </section> <!-- Footer inside main content --> <footer class="bg-slate-50 text-white py-6 mt-auto flex-shrink-0"> <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center text-sm max-w-5xl"> <div class="text-center sm:text-left mb-4 sm:mb-0"> <p>&copy; 2026 SmartUtilBox. All rights reserved.</p> <p class="mt-2 text-slate-400" data-i18n="footer-disclaimer">試算結果僅供參考，實際投資具備風險，請謹慎評估。</p> </div> <div class="space-x-4"> <a href="/privacy-policy" class="hover:text-gray-300 underline" data-i18n="footer-privacy">隱私權政策</a>
                        <a href="/about" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 underline" data-i18n="footer-about">關於</a> <a href="/disclaimer" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 underline" data-i18n="footer-disclaimer">免責聲明</a> <a href="/terms" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 underline" class="hover:text-gray-300 underline" data-i18n="footer-terms">服務條款</a> <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-gray-300 underline" data-i18n="footer-guide">理財專欄</a> </div> </div> </footer>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script is:inline>
</script>
